  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Granskare - anbudsutv&#xe4;rdering ESP  Insats 12331</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Observer -Procurement Environment Support Programme 12331</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ger ekonomiskt st&#xf6;d till de albanska myndigheterna f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra Environmental Support Program (PlanIt id 12331). . I detta avseende beh&#xf6;ver Sida en internationell expert med expertis inom PRAG:s upphandlingsregler f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;vervaka utv&#xe4;rderingen av anbud f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;st&#xf6;dsprogrammet. Den utvalda experten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra med erfarenhet och kunskap f&#xf6;r att ge Sida en f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kran om att upphandlingsprocessen f&#xf6;ljs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida provides financial support to the Albanian authorities for implementing Environmental Support Program (PlanIt id 12331). . In this regard, Sida needs an international expert with expertise in PRAG procurement rules to oversee the evaluation of offers for the Environmental Support Program. The selected expert is expected to bring experience and knowledge to provide assurance to Sida for the adherence of the procurement process.</narrative>
  </description>
